# Line-ending policy. On Windows (core.autocrlf=true) `git archive` converts
# text files to CRLF as if checking them out on Windows — but shell scripts run
# on Linux (Surface WSL / Docker) where CRLF breaks bash
# ("$'\r': command not found", "set: pipefail: invalid option name").
# Force LF for scripts so `git archive HEAD` deploys stay runnable.
# See docs/beta/SURFACE-SERVER.md gotcha #6/#15.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
graphify-out/graph.json merge=graphify
